# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: COUNTIFS counts rows matching every criteria pair")
expect(_eval("=COUNTIFS(B1:B4, \"y\", A1:A4, \">=10\")")).to_equal("2")
expect(_eval("=COUNTIFS(B1:B4, \"x\")")).to_equal("2")
```

</details>

